35,2,1,talk,Midori,,The support was unowned for two days last winter.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The peak season has no freeze window; we tried it and failed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades; the data lift was a mess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year; the last hire took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Capital is cut, but operating costs pass without question.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that confirms my fear. The recurring costs are the real bill.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, the yard devices are old; the trial failed because of spreadsheets.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, yes, the equipment is a patchwork.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, the supervisors dropped the new routines within weeks.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,The separately licensed pieces climbed yearly. The bundled ones held.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need a single point of contact for support.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that survives the November to January crunch.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,We need to avoid another failed data migration.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need to account for the training gap and the retirements.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"We need a fixed price, not a subscription that grows.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
